      "mergedPostDetails": "If you open either the quick or the main menu, and move your mouse at a reasonable speed (or fast), you'll experience a massive constant FPS drop while moving it. Doesn't happen if you move it slowly tho.\n\n1kHz polling rate mouse, parralax background on the menu, only lags the game, overall PC CPU core / GPU usage remains stable.",
